# Identify the app and the Apple ID this project ships under.
#
# What it needs:
#   - app_identifier — the bundle ID matching Project.swift
#   - apple_id — the Apple ID used to sign in to App Store Connect
#
# Optional but useful when you have access to multiple teams:
#   - team_id (Apple Developer Program team)
#   - itc_team_id (App Store Connect team — discoverable during `fastlane init`)
